                        ],
                        "form": "die Verschwörer"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "702dddcf-e12d-3910-b8d7-20cec2bbcc5b",
                        "entry_id": "1d1f71ed-f2ad-3fb1-aaeb-90d12d8e7a9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die sich gegen jemanden verschworen hat/heimlich gegen jemanden intrigiert"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c978202a-7d8f-47af-9950-ad39ad3d70a5",
                                "sense_id": "702dddcf-e12d-3910-b8d7-20cec2bbcc5b",
                                "text": "„Zudem muss Basileios seinen Höflingen misstrauen - etliche seiner Vorgänger sind durch Gift gestorben oder von Verschwörern gestürzt worden.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92224272-9051-4faa-a22a-1ba6de3830cb",
                                "sense_id": "702dddcf-e12d-3910-b8d7-20cec2bbcc5b",
                                "text": "„Die Verschwörer treffen sich heimlich, wer nicht aus freien Stücken teilnimmt, wird gezwungen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf079e41-bfad-4ef6-8b42-bdd4ce13ab9c",
                                "sense_id": "702dddcf-e12d-3910-b8d7-20cec2bbcc5b",
                                "text": "„Der König, den man absetzen wollte, starb, und nun gingen die Verschwörer ganz offen vor; ich möchte meinem Leser nicht die Ereignisse wiederholen, die Stanislaus auf den Thron brachten.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0597f073-410f-4568-a39e-e0de3bb392a0",
                                "sense_id": "702dddcf-e12d-3910-b8d7-20cec2bbcc5b",
                                "text": "„Ein solches Schicksal wurde einem Verschwörer zuteil, der einen Mordanschlag auf Ramses III. verübt hatte.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "15d3fcc2-6601-4442-b4c2-e391027924a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d1f71ed-f2ad-3fb1-aaeb-90d12d8e7a9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "702dddcf-e12d-3910-b8d7-20cec2bbcc5b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die sich gegen jemanden verschworen hat/heimlich gegen jemanden intrigiert",
                        "target_lang_word": "conspirator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conspirator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc8007bf-bce5-3094-9f18-bdfd70a883b6",
                                        "entry_id": "cc762a07-ffae-328f-96a2-23661315d63f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a group that acts in harmony to do something unlawful and unethical; a person who is part of a conspiracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f1287b6-fb9a-45f9-a484-2135f1475c8d",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8007bf-bce5-3094-9f18-bdfd70a883b6",
                                                "text": "The conspirators were rounded up by the police and arrested."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc5524f4-d998-47f2-8a1e-65992728c80d",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8007bf-bce5-3094-9f18-bdfd70a883b6",
                                                "text": "All the Jacobite gentry of that part of the country were collected together; though, it must be confessed, their appearance and their usual after-dinner conversation were rather at variance. Now they looked calm and comfortable, with as little the appearance of conspirators as possible; then they were (by their own account) the most oppressed of individuals, and the most devoted of partisans, ready to die, so that their wrongs were redressed, and the rightful king restored."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
